 *   position         how far it's scrolled, in pixels (scrollTo(px, smooth))
 *   focusIndex       the item the keys are on (-1: none); show(index) scrolls it into view
 *   refresh()        draws every item again (the game's data changed)
 *   loop             scrolling past the end comes round to the start
 *   barWidth, barColor, trackColor, barMargin   the scroll bar (barWidth 0: none)
 *   coasting         how fast a flick slows (a factor a second, 0.05)
 *
